{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "bee6c57f-9b79-4868-b68d-837f6fa22788", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-08-16T18:46:32.877000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "vscode counter好像把.h识别成c++文件了，但是实际上应该是c文件。\n如何配置？"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "bee6c57f-9b79-4868-b68d-837f6fa22788", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 1, "ts": "2026-08-16T18:46:32.876000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/.VSCodeCounter/2026-08-17_02-43-58/results.md", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/.VSCodeCounter/2026-08-17_02-43-58/results.md"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "bee6c57f-9b79-4868-b68d-837f6fa22788", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-08-16T18:46:32.877000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/.vscode/settings.json", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/.vscode/settings.json"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "bee6c57f-9b79-4868-b68d-837f6fa22788", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-08-16T18:46:32.877000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "已完成配置。在 `.vscode/settings.json` 中添加了两项设置：\n\n1. **`files.associations`** — 让 VS Code 将 `*.h` 文件识别为 C 语言\n2. **`vscode-counter.fileExtensions`** — 直接告诉 VSCode Counter 将 `.h` 扩展名映射为 \"C\"\n\n配置后，重新运行 VSCode Counter（命令面板 → `VSCode Counter: Count lines in workspace`）即可看到 `.h` 文件被归类到 C 而非 C++。\n\n> **注意**：如果你的项目中有 C++ 专用的头文件（如 `.hpp`），它们不受影响，仍会被识别为 C++。只有 `.h` 会被统一归为 C。"}
